    "title": "University of Arkansas at Monticello debate team earns 3 awards at tourney - NewsBreak",
    "text": "2 hours ago The University of Arkansas at Monticello debate team earned three awards at the Mississippi State University Bulldog Classic Debate Tournament. Nathaniel Deckelman and Owen Iddings tied for ninth place in the Novice International Public Debate Association category. Deckelman also placed third in the novice speaker division, according to a news release. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
